'''Guzma''' (Japanese: '''グズマ''' ''Guzma'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Discard all Pokémon Tool cards attached to each of your opponent's Pokémon.
}}

